{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32022","headline":"寄韩潮州愈 · 贾岛","name":"寄韩潮州愈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此心曾与木兰舟，直到天南潮水头。\n隔岭篇章来华岳，出关书信过泷流。\n峰悬驿路残云断，海浸城根老树秋。\n一夕瘴烟风卷尽，月明初上浪西楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}